Subject: [PATCH 07258/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5720/5721:
 actions-to-progress metric harness + spec + tests

Reusable bounded-live-solve metric for ARC-AGI-3 capability A/Bs. Two modes:
run_bounded_progress (full e3 drive) + run_seeded_progress (seeded induce->plan->
execute on the live path, guarantees induction fires). Measures a ladder of
floor-busting signals: real level-up + actions-to-progress, dense hand_verifier
goal-distance reduction, and induction quality aggregated over attempts. Paired-by-game
honest stats (sign test + outlier-fragility). Re-tests the /think (5714) and
playbook-retrieval (5716/5717/5718) questions the single-shot proxy left inconclusive.

